# Enduring Courage's two abilities together. Bot2's Lightning Bolt kills it on turn 2 and it returns as an enchantment (it is no longer a creature, but
# it still has its first ability). On turn 3 Bot1 casts Ornithopter and, with Courage's trigger on the stack, Bot2 Lightning Bolts the Ornithopter in
# response (0/2 until the trigger resolves): the entering creature is a new object in the graveyard (CR 400.7), so the trigger does nothing, and neither
# the pump nor the haste is applied to anything. Bot1's second Ornithopter is then pumped by the enchantment Courage (2/2, haste, flying) and hits for 2.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Enduring Courage
Ornithopter
Ornithopter
Mountain x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Lightning Bolt
Lightning Bolt
Mountain
Mountain
Mountain
Mountain
Mountain x12

