Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Enduring Courage.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Enduring Courage)
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main2]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Enduring Courage.Types = Enchantment
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
